      "q": "How much does Department of Commerce spend on contracts?",
      "a": "The Department of Commerce has obligated $3.8B in contracts in FY2026 to date. The Department of Commerce recorded 7,438 awards and an average award size of $517K. The Department of Commerce obligations fell 7.6% year over year."
