    {
      "q": "What does Commerce buy?",
      "a": "The Department of Commerce buys mostly IT and professional services in FY2026 to date. Other Computer Related Services received $721M, Computer Systems Design Services received $580M, and Custom Computer Programming Services received $402M. The Department of Commerce also obligates funds to publishing and consulting, with All Other Publishers at $220M and Administrative Management and General Management Consulting Services at $176M."
